  "name": "Kanban Supply Exceptions Advisor",
  "description": "This is the a Kanban Supplier Exceptions Agent, the task of this agentic workflow is to list down all the Unmoved Cards(Count of Active Kanban Cards (Status = Full, IN_PROCESS, EMPTY) for which the difference between the  current date/time and last activity date/time is more than 2% of the Replenishment Lead Time maintained in the Pull Sequence). I also show the kanban card activities details for a specified kanban card number.",
